  "name": "Workflow-Guided Exploration research code",
  "notes": "The released repository includes training policies, experiment configuration and a MiniWoB sandbox extended for the 2018 paper. This is the WGE implementation, not another copy of the already cataloged Farama MiniWoB++ benchmark and not the original OpenAI MiniWoB release. Its documented dependency is PyTorch 0.1.12, and current runtime compatibility was not tested. Stanford code declares Apache-2.0; bundled third-party browser tasks and externally downloaded demonstration/embedding data retain their own terms.",
